null}, "comments": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/567039178", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/937#issuecomment-567039178", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/937", "id": 567039178, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NzAzOTE3OA==", "user": {"login": "JonasVautherin", "id": 2606672, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2MDY2NzI=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2606672?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin", "html_url": "https://github.com/JonasVautherin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/JonasVautherin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-18T13:50:06Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-18T13:50:06Z", "body": "I see that [VFR_HUD](https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#VFR_HUD) is defined as follows:\r\n\r\n```\r\nMetrics typically displayed on a HUD for fixed wing aircraft.\r\n\r\nairspeed     | float    | m/s | Current indicated airspeed (IAS).\r\ngroundspeed  | float    | m/s | Current ground speed.\r\nheading      | int16_t  | deg | Current heading in compass units (0-360, 0=north).\r\nthrottle     | uint16_t | %   | Current throttle setting (0 to 100).\r\nalt          | float    | m   | Current altitude (MSL).\r\nclimb        | float    | m/s | Current climb rate.\r\n```\r\n\r\nFor information, we have a [`GroundSpeedNed`](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto/blob/master/protos/telemetry/telemetry.proto#L34) that emits [`SpeedNed`](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto/blob/master/protos/telemetry/telemetry.proto#L201-L206) events.\r\n\r\nI guess VFR_HUD is only emitted for fixed wing or VTOL (in fixed wind mode) aircrafts? Or is it also emitted for multicopters (I guess multicopers typically don't compute their airspeed, do they?)?", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/567039178/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/567408044", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/937#issuecomment-567408044", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/937", "id": 567408044, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NzQwODA0NA==", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2019-12-19T09:25:43Z", "updated_at": "2019-12-19T09:25:43Z", "body": "> I guess VFR_HUD is only emitted for fixed wing or VTOL (in fixed wind mode) aircrafts? Or is it also emitted for multicopters (I guess multicopers typically don't compute their airspeed, do they?)?\r\n\r\nGood question. We'd have to try it out.\r\n\r\nAnyway, you can add it to the telemetry plugin, and I think the `VFR_HUD` message is the one to use.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/567408044/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/567440483", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/937#issuecomment-567440483", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/937", "id": 567440483, "node_id": "MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDU2NzQ0MDQ4Mw==", "user": {"login": "itrigitech", "id": 54359274, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjU0MzU5Mjc0", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54359274?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/itrigitech", "html_url": "https://github.com/itrigitech", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/itrigitech/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/itrigitech/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/itrigitech/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/itrigitech/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/itrigitech/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/itrigitech/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/itrigitech/repos", "events_url": "http